>> title: Chermoula
>> category: Spice Blends & Marinades
>> tags: moroccan, herbs, fish, marinade, no-cook
>> counters: Shawarma Counter
>> aka: charmoula
>> pairs-with: lamb-tagine
>> servings: 6
>> time: 15 min

>> step: pound to a paste in a mortar
Pound @garlic{4%cloves} with @kosher salt{1%tsp} to a smooth paste in a #mortar{}.

>> step: work in
Work @ground cumin{2%tsp}, @ground coriander{1%tsp}, @sweet paprika{2%tsp}, and @cayenne{1/2%tsp} into @&(~1)garlic paste{}.

>> step: stir in
Stir @cilantro{1%cup}(finely chopped, stems and all) and @flat-leaf parsley{1/2%cup}(finely chopped) into @&(~1)spice paste{}.

>> step: whisk in
Whisk @lemon juice{3%Tbs}(45 mL) and @extra-virgin olive oil{1/2%cup}(120 mL) into @&(~1)chermoula{}.
